            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.58

- Click any line in the full screen lyrics to jump the song to it. The highlight moves the instant you click rather than waiting for playback to report back, and clicking also hands scrolling back to the song if you had scrolled away to read ahead. Instrumental markers jump to the start of the break.
]]></description>
